3 x ₹1,650 = ₹4,950

Your new total quantity will be 15 shares.

To calculate the average price, you can divide the total cost by the new total quantity:

(₹19,200 + ₹4,950) ÷ 15 = ₹1,663.33

So, your new average price for HDFCBANK is approximately ₹1,663.33.

